  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello English learners and welcome back to another episode of EnglishPod.",
      "trans": "您好英语学习者，欢迎再次观看我的英文听力节目。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.6000000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "My name is Marco.",
      "trans": "我的名字是Marco。",
      "start": 5.6000000000000005,
      "end": 6.8
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我是艾瑞克。",
      "start": 6.8,
      "end": 8.120000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "And today with Erica, we are getting married.",
      "trans": "今天和埃里卡结婚。",
      "start": 8.120000000000001,
      "end": 11.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, we're not getting married.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，我们不是结婚。",
      "start": 11.08,
      "end": 14.32
    },
    {
      "text": "We're not, but our actors in the podcast are.",
      "trans": "我们不是，但我们的演员在播客里。",
      "start": 14.32,
      "end": 17.48
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "英语：That's right.",
      "start": 17.48,
      "end": 18.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've got a lesson today about weddings.",
      "trans": "今天，我们学习了关于婚礼的课程。",
      "start": 18.48,
      "end": 22.400000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And you know what?",
      "trans": "英语：And you know what?",
      "start": 22.400000000000002,
      "end": 23.400000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "A lot of the language in this lesson is about weddings and marriages.",
      "trans": "这个课程里有很多关于婚礼和婚姻的语言。",
      "start": 23.400000000000002,
      "end": 29.080000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And maybe you don't need to use this language every day.",
      "trans": "或许你不需要每天都使用这个语言。",
      "start": 29.08,
      "end": 33.44
    },
    {
      "text": "But learning this vocabulary will definitely help you understand or learn a lot more about",
      "trans": "但是学习这些词汇将非常有助于你了解或学习更多。",
      "start": 33.44,
      "end": 39.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Anglo culture.",
      "trans": "英语：英国文化。",
      "start": 39.4,
      "end": 40.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, great point Marco.",
      "trans": "好的，马克。",
      "start": 40.4,
      "end": 41.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I think now we can look at our vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "我感觉现在我们可以看看我们的词汇预览。",
      "start": 41.96,
      "end": 46.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 48.04
    },
    {
      "text": "So two simple words in this vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "这个词汇预览里有这么两个简单的单词。",
      "start": 48.04,
      "end": 51.4
    },
    {
      "text": "The first one is groom.",
      "trans": "第一个是整理。",
      "start": 51.4,
      "end": 54.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Grume.",
      "trans": "格缪尔。",
      "start": 54.8,
      "end": 55.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Grume.",
      "trans": "格穆。",
      "start": 55.8,
      "end": 56.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Grume.",
      "trans": "格缪尔。",
      "start": 56.8,
      "end": 57.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Who is the groom?",
      "trans": "谁是新娘？",
      "start": 57.8,
      "end": 59.879999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the man.",
      "trans": "是这个人。",
      "start": 59.879999999999995,
      "end": 60.879999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "The man that's getting married.",
      "trans": "英语：The man that's getting married.",
      "start": 60.879999999999995,
      "end": 61.879999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 61.879999999999995,
      "end": 62.879999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "And our second word is...",
      "trans": "和我们的第二个单词是...。",
      "start": 62.879999999999995,
      "end": 65.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bride.",
      "trans": "新娘。",
      "start": 65.08,
      "end": 66.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bride.",
      "trans": "新娘。",
      "start": 66.08,
      "end": 67.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Bride.",
      "trans": "新娘。",
      "start": 67.08,
      "end": 68.08
    },
    {
      "text": "And obviously the bride is...",
      "trans": "当然，新娘是...",
      "start": 68.08,
      "end": 69.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "The woman getting married.",
      "trans": "新娘正在结婚。",
      "start": 69.75999999999999,
      "end": 71.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect.",
      "trans": "很好。",
      "start": 71.08,
      "end": 72.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we have our bride and our groom.",
      "trans": "现在我们有了我们的新娘和新郎。",
      "start": 72.08,
      "end": 74.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's time to listen to our dialogue the first time.",
      "trans": "所以，我们第一次对话的时间到了。",
      "start": 74.12,
      "end": 77.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.",
      "trans": "英语：我简直不敢相信安东尼奥终于结婚了。",
      "start": 88.8,
      "end": 91.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well it's about time.",
      "trans": "是的，嗯，这正是时候。",
      "start": 91.88,
      "end": 93.32
    },
    {
      "text": "He's been living with his parents for 40 years.",
      "trans": "他一直和父母生活在一起已经有40年了。",
      "start": 93.32,
      "end": 95.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't be mean.",
      "trans": "英语：不要那么做。",
      "start": 95.67999999999999,
      "end": 97.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, here come the bridesmaids.",
      "trans": "请看，来了新娘子。",
      "start": 97.67999999999999,
      "end": 99.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, their dresses look beautiful.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，他们的裙子看起来非常漂亮。",
      "start": 99.72,
      "end": 101.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Who are those kids walking in the aisle?",
      "trans": "谁在 aisle 里走动的那些孩子？",
      "start": 101.52,
      "end": 103.72
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the flower girl and the ring bearer.",
      "trans": "这个花姑娘和戒指的领带。",
      "start": 103.72,
      "end": 106.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm pretty sure that they're the groom's niece and nephew.",
      "trans": "英语：我保证他们是 groom 的侄子和侄女。",
      "start": 106.56,
      "end": 108.75999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, they look so cute.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，它们看起来那么可爱。",
      "start": 108.75999999999999,
      "end": 110.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.",
      "trans": "我只想希望这个僧侣能尽快完成。",
      "start": 110.52,
      "end": 112.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Starving.",
      "trans": "饿了。",
      "start": 112.64,
      "end": 113.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.",
      "trans": "我希望餐厅的食物很好。",
      "start": 113.64,
      "end": 115.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all you ever think about.",
      "trans": "这就是你唯一关心的事。",
      "start": 115.68,
      "end": 117.32000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Food.",
      "trans": "食物。",
      "start": 117.32000000000001,
      "end": 118.32000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我想新娘来了。",
      "start": 118.32000000000001,
      "end": 120.84
    },
    {
      "text": "She looks gorgeous.",
      "trans": "她看起来非常漂亮。",
      "start": 120.84,
      "end": 122.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait, what's she doing?",
      "trans": "英语：等，她在干什么？",
      "start": 124.96000000000001,
      "end": 126.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Where is she going?",
      "trans": "英语：Where is she going?",
      "start": 126.88,
      "end": 127.96000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So great.",
      "trans": "英语：所以很好。",
      "start": 127.96000000000001,
      "end": 129.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Does this mean the reception is canceled?",
      "trans": "是的，这表示会议已经取消。",
      "start": 129.36,
      "end": 131.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, Marco, that's so sad.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，马科，那真是太伤心了。",
      "start": 135.92000000000002,
      "end": 138.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I know.",
      "trans": "是的，我知道。",
      "start": 138.44,
      "end": 139.44
    },
    {
      "text": "The reception is canceled.",
      "trans": "英语：它被取消了。",
      "start": 139.44,
      "end": 141.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Marco!",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接翻译中文到另一种语言。不过，我可以提供一些关于“Marco”的信息：",
      "start": 141.04,
      "end": 142.04
    },
    {
      "text": "What?",
      "trans": "什么?",
      "start": 142.04,
      "end": 143.04
    },
    {
      "text": "They're not getting married.",
      "trans": "他们还没有结婚。",
      "start": 143.04,
      "end": 144.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, well, I mean, the best part is when you go and eat and drink at the reception.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，好吧，就是当你去餐厅和酒吧时最好的部分。",
      "start": 144.04,
      "end": 148.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 148.64,
      "end": 149.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, there's some great language in this dialogue.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英语内容。",
      "start": 149.64,
      "end": 152.23999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "And now, let's look at our language takeaway.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 152.23999999999998,
      "end": 156.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Language takeaway.",
      "trans": "语言总结。",
      "start": 157.84,
      "end": 159.23999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请将需要翻译的英文语句提供给我吧。",
      "start": 160.23999999999998,
      "end": 161.23999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Our first word on the language takeaway today is, it's about time.",
      "trans": "今天的语言小贴士是，时间不等人。",
      "start": 161.23999999999998,
      "end": 165.23999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "英语：它的时间到了。",
      "start": 165.23999999999998,
      "end": 167.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "英语：It's about time.",
      "start": 167.64,
      "end": 169.04
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "时间到了。",
      "start": 169.04,
      "end": 170.44
    },
    {
      "text": "So now, we are going to listen to some examples on how we use this great phrase.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 170.44,
      "end": 177.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "Example one: 一台单反相机。",
      "start": 177.64,
      "end": 178.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Dinner's ready.",
      "trans": "饭已经准备好了。",
      "start": 181.64,
      "end": 182.84
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "英语：它的时间到了。",
      "start": 182.84,
      "end": 183.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm starving.",
      "trans": "我饿了。",
      "start": 183.84,
      "end": 184.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 188.04,
      "end": 189.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Guess what?",
      "trans": "英语：猜什么？",
      "start": 192.44,
      "end": 193.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I finally got a job.",
      "trans": "我终于找到了工作。",
      "start": 193.44,
      "end": 194.84
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "英语：它的时间到了。",
      "start": 194.84,
      "end": 195.84
    },
    {
      "text": "You've been unemployed for two years.",
      "trans": "你已经失业两年了。",
      "start": 195.84,
      "end": 197.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Example three.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 201.44,
      "end": 203.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We're almost there, just a couple more minutes.",
      "trans": "我们离目标还差几分钟。",
      "start": 207.04,
      "end": 209.24
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about time.",
      "trans": "英语：它的时间到了。",
      "start": 209.24,
      "end": 210.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We've been driving for 12 hours.",
      "trans": "我们已经驾驶了12小时。",
      "start": 210.44,
      "end": 213.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So this phrase means, finally.",
      "trans": "所以这个短语意味着，最终。",
      "start": 215.44,
      "end": 218.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Finally, at last.",
      "trans": "最后，终于。",
      "start": 218.44,
      "end": 220.24
    },
    {
      "text": "We've been waiting a long time for this.",
      "trans": "我们已经等待了很久了。",
      "start": 220.24,
      "end": 222.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 222.64,
      "end": 223.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so it's about time.",
      "trans": "好的，现在请将“Okay, so it's about time”翻译成简体中文。",
      "start": 223.64,
      "end": 226.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 226.24,
      "end": 227.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at our second word now.",
      "trans": "让我们看看我们的第二个单词。",
      "start": 227.24,
      "end": 229.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll.",
      "trans": "我会。 (Wǒ huì.)",
      "start": 229.44,
      "end": 230.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll.",
      "trans": "我会。 (Wǒ huì.)",
      "start": 230.44,
      "end": 231.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll.",
      "trans": "我会。 (Wǒ huì.)",
      "start": 235.04000000000002,
      "end": 236.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, but it's spelled so strangely.",
      "trans": "是的，但看起来有点奇怪。",
      "start": 240.64000000000001,
      "end": 243.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是该短语的翻译：",
      "start": 243.44,
      "end": 244.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't pronounce the S. The S is silent.",
      "trans": "我们不发音S。",
      "start": 244.04000000000002,
      "end": 246.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That's true.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“这就是正确的。”",
      "start": 246.44,
      "end": 247.44
    },
    {
      "text": "In a big room where you have a lot of chairs, that space in the middle that allows people to walk through, that's the I'll.",
      "trans": "在一间大房间里，你有好多椅子的地方，中间那个能让你通过的人行道是……。",
      "start": 250.04000000000002,
      "end": 258.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So the aisle is the part where you walk.",
      "trans": "所以， aisle 是你走路的部分。",
      "start": 258.24,
      "end": 260.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. In a big room.",
      "trans": "是的。在大房间里。",
      "start": 260.84000000000003,
      "end": 262.04
    },
    {
      "text": "In a big room with many chairs.",
      "trans": "在大房间里有很多椅子。",
      "start": 262.04,
      "end": 263.64
    },
    {
      "text": "With many chairs.",
      "trans": "有很多椅子。",
      "start": 263.64,
      "end": 264.44
    },
    {
      "text": "So in the church, the bride and groom walked on the aisle.",
      "trans": "所以，在教堂里，新娘和新郎在过道上走着。",
      "start": 265.64,
      "end": 269.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 269.84000000000003,
      "end": 270.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 270.84000000000003,
      "end": 271.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's move to our third word.",
      "trans": "让我们移动到我们的第三个单词。",
      "start": 271.84000000000003,
      "end": 273.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Bridesmaid.",
      "trans": "新娘子。",
      "start": 273.04,
      "end": 274.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Bridesmaid.",
      "trans": "新娘子。",
      "start": 274.44,
      "end": 276.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Bridesmaid.",
      "trans": "新娘子。",
      "start": 276.44,
      "end": 277.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So who are the bridesmaids?",
      "trans": "所以谁是新娘的伴娘？",
      "start": 277.64,
      "end": 279.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Or wait, maybe you should ask me that.",
      "trans": "英语：或者，也许你最好问问我。",
      "start": 279.04,
      "end": 280.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, because we don't get bridesmaids.",
      "trans": "是的，因为我们在没有伴娘的情况下拍摄。",
      "start": 280.84000000000003,
      "end": 284.24
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so the bridesmaids are the women who are friends of the bride who stand next to her when she's getting married.",
