      "start": 284.24,
      "end": 291.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Usually they're her best friends.",
      "trans": "通常他们是最亲密的朋友。",
      "start": 291.84000000000003,
      "end": 294.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 294.04,
      "end": 294.64
    },
    {
      "text": "OK.",
      "trans": "OK in Chinese is \"好的\" (kě de).",
      "start": 294.64,
      "end": 295.64
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so we have our bridesmaids.",
      "trans": "好的，所以我们有我们的伴娘。",
      "start": 295.64,
      "end": 297.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we have our flower girl.",
      "trans": "现在我们有了花蝴蝶小姐。",
      "start": 297.64,
      "end": 300.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Flower girl.",
      "trans": "玫瑰花女。",
      "start": 300.84000000000003,
      "end": 302.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Flower girl.",
      "trans": "玫瑰花女。",
      "start": 302.24,
      "end": 303.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, I'll explain this one.",
      "trans": "英语：再次，我将对此进行解释。",
      "start": 303.84000000000003,
      "end": 305.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Please, please.",
      "trans": "请，请。",
      "start": 305.44,
      "end": 306.64
    },
    {
      "text": "The flower girl is that cute little girl who walks down the aisle and who throws",
      "trans": "花仙子就是那个穿着漂亮的小女孩，她走到 aisle 上来，然后扔。",
      "start": 306.64,
      "end": 314.04
    },
    {
      "text": "flowers.",
      "trans": "玫瑰。",
      "start": 314.04,
      "end": 315.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the flower girl.",
      "trans": "那就是花仙子。",
      "start": 315.64000000000004,
      "end": 316.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "And with the flower girl, we have our ring bearer.",
      "trans": "并且有我们的伴郎。",
      "start": 316.84000000000003,
      "end": 321.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Ring bearer.",
      "trans": "环路使用者。",
      "start": 321.64000000000004,
      "end": 323.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Ring bearer.",
      "trans": "英文：Ring bearer.",
      "start": 323.84000000000003,
      "end": 325.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "So the ring bearer is the cute little boy who walks down the aisle carrying the rings.",
      "trans": "所以，环套者是那个穿着警服的小伙子，他带着戒指走下楼梯。",
      "start": 325.64000000000004,
      "end": 332.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 332.64000000000004,
      "end": 333.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so a lot of useful vocabulary for a wedding ceremony.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 333.64000000000004,
      "end": 337.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "That's true.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“这就是正确的。”",
      "start": 337.64000000000004,
      "end": 338.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's look at our last word.",
      "trans": "现在让我们看看我们的最后一个单词。",
      "start": 338.64000000000004,
      "end": 340.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Gorgeous.",
      "trans": "漂亮。",
      "start": 340.64000000000004,
      "end": 341.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Gorgeous.",
      "trans": "漂亮。",
      "start": 341.64000000000004,
      "end": 343.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Gorgeous means beautiful.",
      "trans": "漂亮意味着美丽。",
      "start": 343.24,
      "end": 347.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Very beautiful.",
      "trans": "非常漂亮。",
      "start": 347.04,
      "end": 348.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, you know, beautiful.",
      "trans": "是的，你懂的。",
      "start": 348.04,
      "end": 349.64
    },
    {
      "text": "You can only use with a woman.",
      "trans": "你只能用在女人身上。",
      "start": 349.64,
      "end": 351.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Can you use gorgeous with a woman or with a man?",
      "trans": "是的，你可以用漂亮的与女性或男性交谈。",
      "start": 351.84000000000003,
      "end": 354.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, gorgeous is unisex.",
      "trans": "是的，这个漂亮是无性别。",
      "start": 354.84000000000003,
      "end": 356.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "So both men and women are gorgeous.",
      "trans": "所以，男人和女人都是漂亮的。",
      "start": 356.84000000000003,
      "end": 359.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, you can say, oh, that girl is gorgeous.",
      "trans": "正确翻译：英语：Right, you can say, oh, that girl is gorgeous.",
      "start": 359.44,
      "end": 362.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That guy is gorgeous.",
      "trans": "那个家伙很帅。",
      "start": 362.44,
      "end": 364.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是该短语的中文翻译：",
      "start": 364.44,
      "end": 365.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Or you can say even this house is gorgeous.",
      "trans": "英语：或者你可以说这房子很漂亮。",
      "start": 365.04,
      "end": 368.44
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so men, women, objects.",
      "trans": "好的，所以男人、女人和物体。",
      "start": 368.44,
      "end": 370.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, yes.",
      "trans": "是的，是的。",
      "start": 370.64,
      "end": 371.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, well, we've learned some really interesting vocabulary that will help us to",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 371.84,
      "end": 377.11999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "understand an Anglo wedding.",
      "trans": "英语：理解一个英国婚礼。",
      "start": 377.11999999999995,
      "end": 379.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we listen to the dialogue slowed down?",
      "trans": "所以为什么不让我们慢下来听对话呢？",
      "start": 379.84,
      "end": 383.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.",
      "trans": "我简直不敢相信安东尼奥终于结婚了。",
      "start": 383.23999999999995,
      "end": 394.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, it's about time.",
      "trans": "嗯，差不多了。",
      "start": 394.23999999999995,
      "end": 397.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "He's been living with his parents for 40 years.",
      "trans": "他一直和父母生活在一起已经有40年了。",
      "start": 397.23999999999995,
      "end": 401.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't be mean.",
      "trans": "英语：不要那么做。",
      "start": 401.44,
      "end": 403.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, here come the bridesmaids.",
      "trans": "请看，来了新娘子。",
      "start": 403.04,
      "end": 406.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Their dresses look beautiful.",
      "trans": "他们的衣服看起来很漂亮。",
      "start": 406.64,
      "end": 409.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Who are those kids walking down the aisle?",
      "trans": "英语：谁在过道上走？",
      "start": 409.64,
      "end": 413.04
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the flower girl and the ring bearer.",
      "trans": "这个花姑娘和戒指的领带。",
      "start": 413.04,
      "end": 416.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm pretty sure they're the groom's niece and nephew.",
      "trans": "我非常确定他们是 groom 的侄子和侄女。",
      "start": 416.64,
      "end": 420.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, they look so cute.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，它们看起来那么可爱。",
      "start": 420.64,
      "end": 424.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.",
      "trans": "我只想希望这个僧侣能尽快完成。",
      "start": 424.64,
      "end": 427.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm starving.",
      "trans": "我饿了。",
      "start": 427.44,
      "end": 429.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.",
      "trans": "我希望餐厅的食物很好。",
      "start": 429.04,
      "end": 431.24
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all you ever think about.",
      "trans": "这就是你唯一关心的事情。",
      "start": 431.24,
      "end": 433.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Food.",
      "trans": "食物。",
      "start": 433.64,
      "end": 434.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I think the brides coming now.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我想现在来的新娘。",
      "start": 434.64,
      "end": 437.64
    },
    {
      "text": "She looks gorgeous.",
      "trans": "她看起来非常漂亮。",
      "start": 437.64,
      "end": 440.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait, what's she doing?",
      "trans": "英语：等，她在干什么？",
      "start": 440.84000000000003,
      "end": 443.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Where is she going?",
      "trans": "英语：Where is she going?",
      "start": 443.64,
      "end": 445.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, great.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，好！",
      "start": 445.64,
      "end": 447.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Does this mean that the reception is canceled?",
      "trans": "是的，这表示会议取消了。",
      "start": 447.64,
      "end": 450.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Now in this dialogue, we have a word that many students often make mistakes on.",
      "trans": "英语：现在在对话中，我们有一个经常犯错的单词。",
      "start": 453.64,
      "end": 459.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "So this is a word that causes a lot of problems.",
      "trans": "所以这个词导致很多问题。",
      "start": 459.84,
      "end": 463.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, the word Mary.",
      "trans": "是的，玛丽。",
      "start": 463.23999999999995,
      "end": 465.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Mary.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"Mary\"可以翻译为 \"玛丽亚\"。",
      "start": 465.84,
      "end": 466.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Mary, right?",
      "trans": "英语：Mary，对吗？",
      "start": 466.84,
      "end": 468.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "So we are going to listen now to some common mistakes on how English learners use this word.",
      "trans": "英语：所以我们将现在听一些关于如何使用这个单词的常见错误。",
      "start": 468.23999999999995,
      "end": 475.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, so these are wrong examples.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 475.64,
      "end": 479.03999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "Example one: 一台单反相机。",
      "start": 479.03999999999996,
      "end": 481.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Honey, let's marry.",
      "trans": "蜜，让我们结婚。",
      "start": 481.84,
      "end": 485.03999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 485.03999999999996,
      "end": 487.64
    },
    {
      "text": "We married four years ago.",
      "trans": "我们结婚已经四年了。",
      "start": 487.64,
      "end": 490.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Example three.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 490.44,
      "end": 493.24
    },
    {
      "text": "When I marry, I want a huge wedding.",
      "trans": "当我想结婚时，我想要一个巨大的婚礼。",
      "start": 493.24,
      "end": 497.24
    },
    {
      "text": "These are great examples of mistakes students make with the word Mary.",
      "trans": "这些是学生犯错误的例子，与Mary这个词有关。",
      "start": 497.24,
      "end": 502.64
    },
    {
      "text": "They're missing a word.",
      "trans": "他们缺少一个单词。",
      "start": 502.64,
      "end": 504.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen to these right examples to see what word is missing.",
      "trans": "让我们听听这些例子，看看哪个单词是缺失的。",
      "start": 504.84,
      "end": 510.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "Example one: 一台单反相机。",
      "start": 510.84,
      "end": 514.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Honey, let's get married.",
      "trans": "英语：蜜，让我们结婚。",
      "start": 514.84,
      "end": 520.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "Example two. 例2.",
      "start": 520.24,
      "end": 524.0400000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "We got married four years ago.",
      "trans": "我们已经结婚四年了。",
      "start": 524.0400000000001,
      "end": 529.0400000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Example three.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 529.0400000000001,
      "end": 533.24
    },
    {
      "text": "When I get married, I want a huge wedding.",
      "trans": "当我在结婚时，我想有一个巨大的婚礼。",
      "start": 533.24,
      "end": 538.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Great.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 538.64,
      "end": 539.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So we can see that when we use the word Mary, we say to get married.",
      "trans": "所以当我们使用“玛丽”这个单词时，我们可以说“结婚”。",
      "start": 539.64,
      "end": 544.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly right.",
      "trans": "正确无误。",
      "start": 544.84,
      "end": 546.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Get married.",
      "trans": "结婚。",
      "start": 546.24,
      "end": 547.24
    },
    {
      "text": "To get married, right?",
      "trans": "To get married, right? 翻译成中文是：结婚，对吗？",
      "start": 547.24,
      "end": 548.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, don't forget that.",
      "trans": "好的，不用客气。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 548.24,
      "end": 549.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 549.64,
      "end": 550.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Get married.",
      "trans": "英语：结婚。",
      "start": 550.64,
      "end": 551.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I will get married.",
      "trans": "我将结婚。",
      "start": 551.64,
      "end": 552.84
    },
    {
      "text": "We got married.",
      "trans": "我们结婚了。",
      "start": 552.84,
      "end": 553.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 553.84,
      "end": 554.84
    },
    {
      "text": "So now you know exactly how to use this word.",
      "trans": "所以现在你就能熟练地使用这个词了。",
      "start": 554.84,
      "end": 558.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "We are ready to listen to our dialogue again for the third time.",
      "trans": "我们已经准备好了，再次聆听我们的对话。",
      "start": 558.3199999999999,
      "end": 562.96
    },
    {
      "text": "And this time it's going to be at a normal speed.",
      "trans": "英语：和这次速度一样快。",
      "start": 562.96,
      "end": 565.4399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.",
      "trans": "英语：我简直不敢相信安东尼奥终于结婚了。",
      "start": 569.64,
      "end": 572.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, it's about time.",
      "trans": "嗯，好啊。时间不早了。",
      "start": 572.64,
      "end": 574.64
    },
    {
      "text": "You've been living with his parents for 40 years.",
      "trans": "你已经养了他父母40年。",
      "start": 574.64,
      "end": 576.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't be mean.",
      "trans": "英语：不要那么做。",
      "start": 576.64,
      "end": 578.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, here come the bridesmaids.",
      "trans": "请看，来了新娘子。",
      "start": 578.64,
      "end": 580.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, their dresses look beautiful.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，他们的裙子看起来很漂亮。",
      "start": 580.64,
      "end": 582.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Who are those kids walking in the aisle?",
      "trans": "谁在 aisle 里走的这些孩子？",
      "start": 582.64,
      "end": 584.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the flower girl and the ring bearer.",
      "trans": "这个花姑娘和戒指的领带。",
      "start": 584.64,
      "end": 586.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm pretty sure that they're the grooms niece and nephew.",
      "trans": "我保证他们是表姐和表弟。",
      "start": 586.64,
      "end": 589.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, they look so cute.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，它们看起来那么可爱。",
      "start": 589.64,
      "end": 591.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.",
      "trans": "我只想希望这个僧侣能尽快完成。",
      "start": 591.64,
      "end": 593.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Starving.",
      "trans": "饿了。",
      "start": 593.64,
      "end": 594.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.",
      "trans": "我希望能食物在接待处做得好。",
      "start": 594.64,
      "end": 596.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all you ever think about.",
      "trans": "这就是你唯一关心的事情。",
      "start": 596.64,
      "end": 598.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Food.",
      "trans": "食物。",
      "start": 598.64,
      "end": 599.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我想新娘来了。",
      "start": 599.64,
      "end": 601.64
    },
    {
      "text": "She looks gorgeous.",
      "trans": "她看起来非常漂亮。",
      "start": 601.64,
      "end": 603.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait, what's she doing?",
      "trans": "英语：等，她在干什么？",
      "start": 605.64,
      "end": 607.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Where is she going?",
      "trans": "英语：Where is she going?",
      "start": 607.64,
      "end": 608.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So great.",
      "trans": "英语：所以很好。",
      "start": 608.64,
      "end": 609.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Does this mean the reception is canceled?",
      "trans": "是的，这表示会议取消了。",
      "start": 609.64,
      "end": 612.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, well, I'm going to be honest with you.",
      "trans": "好的，明白了。",
      "start": 615.64,
      "end": 617.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know too much about marriages because, first of all, I'm not married.",
      "trans": "英语：我不知道很多关于婚姻的事情，因为首先我还不结婚。",
      "start": 617.64,
      "end": 622.64
    },
    {
      "text": "And I've never really been to many marriages.",
      "trans": "我从没真正去过很多婚姻。",
      "start": 622.64,
      "end": 625.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Erica, some questions for you.",
      "trans": "英语：所以，埃里卡，你有什么问题吗？",
      "start": 625.64,
      "end": 627.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 627.64,
      "end": 628.64
    },
    {
      "text": "What are these bridesmaids do?",
      "trans": "这些新娘子做什么？",
      "start": 628.64,
      "end": 630.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, what are they about?",
      "trans": "我指的是，他们是什么意思？",
      "start": 630.64,
      "end": 631.64
    },
    {
      "text": "What are the bridesmaids do?",
      "trans": "在婚礼上，新娘的伴娘们做什么？",
      "start": 631.64,
      "end": 632.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, what are they doing there?",
      "trans": "是的，他们在做什么呢？",
      "start": 632.64,
      "end": 634.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, like I said earlier, the bridesmaids are the friends of the bride.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，就像我之前说的那样，新娘子是婚礼的姐妹。",
      "start": 634.64,
      "end": 639.64
    },
    {
      "text": "But the most important people, besides the bride and groom,",
      "trans": "但是最重要的，除了新娘和新郎之外，还有许多其他重要的人。",
      "start": 639.64,
      "end": 643.64
    },
    {
      "text": "are the best man and the maid of honor.",
      "trans": "是最佳的伴娘和伴郎。",
      "start": 643.64,
      "end": 648.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, and what do they do there in the ceremony?",
      "trans": "好的，现在请将“Okay, and what do they do there in the ceremony?” 用简化中文翻译。",
      "start": 648.64,
      "end": 650.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, what they do is they sign the marriage license.",
      "trans": "英语：他们做的是什么？是签署结婚证书吗？",
      "start": 650.64,
      "end": 655.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 655.64,
      "end": 656.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So they're like witnesses.",
      "trans": "所以他们像证人一样。",
      "start": 656.64,
      "end": 658.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 658.64,
      "end": 659.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 659.64,
      "end": 660.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So, but wait a minute.",
      "trans": "英语：所以，但等一下。",
      "start": 660.64,
      "end": 661.64
    },
    {
      "text": "They sign the marriage license there in the church?",
      "trans": "他们在那里在教堂签署结婚证书吗？",
      "start": 661.64,
      "end": 663.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, of course.",
      "trans": "是的，当然。",
      "start": 663.64,
      "end": 664.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Right inside the church, you sign the marriage license.",
      "trans": "右进教堂，你签婚约。",
      "start": 664.64,
      "end": 667.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, that's strange.",
      "trans": "英语：哇，那可怪了。",
      "start": 667.64,
      "end": 668.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Because from what I know, in other countries, usually you will sign the marriage license before the ceremony.",
      "trans": "因为根据我所知，通常在婚礼之前，在其他国家你将签署结婚证书。",
      "start": 668.64,
      "end": 675.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you get married twice.",
      "trans": "所以，你两次结婚。",
      "start": 675.64,
      "end": 677.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, you have the civil marriage, and then you have the church wedding or whatever.",
      "trans": "是的，你有婚姻证书，然后还有教堂婚礼或其他形式的婚礼。",
      "start": 677.64,
      "end": 682.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That's so complicated.",
      "trans": "这个傻瓜相机太复杂了。",
      "start": 682.64,
      "end": 683.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, yeah, I mean, the church wedding is just a ceremony.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，对，教堂婚礼只是仪式。",
      "start": 683.64,
      "end": 687.64
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not really anything official.",
      "trans": "英语：它不是真的官方。",
      "start": 687.64,
      "end": 689.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, in Canada, it's the official part as well.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，在加拿大，这是官方部分。",
      "start": 689.64,
      "end": 691.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I guess maybe you're just more efficient.",
      "trans": "我猜你可能效率更高。",
      "start": 691.64,
      "end": 693.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe.",
      "trans": "可能。",
      "start": 693.64,
      "end": 694.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, this is a really fascinating, a really interesting subject, isn't it?",
      "trans": "英语：很好，这真是一个非常有趣、非常有趣的主题，不是吗？",
      "start": 694.64,
      "end": 699.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, because there are so many countries that have different marriage ceremonies.",
      "trans": "是的，因为有很多国家有不同的结婚仪式。",
      "start": 699.64,
      "end": 703.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I know that marriage is in India last around seven days.",
      "trans": "我了解，结婚是在印度七天后。",
      "start": 703.64,
      "end": 706.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "trans": "是的，是的。",
      "start": 706.64,
      "end": 707.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to know more about how our users get married in their country.",
      "trans": "我想要了解我们用户在他们国家如何结婚的。",
      "start": 707.64,
      "end": 711.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so please go to our website at EnglishPod.com and tell us how you get married in your countries.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我如何通过我们的网站与您联系并告知您的婚礼地点和日期。",
      "start": 711.64,
      "end": 718.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I can't wait to hear your stories.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 718.64,
      "end": 721.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it should be interesting, right?",
      "trans": "是的，应该挺有趣的。",
      "start": 721.64,
      "end": 723.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 723.64,
      "end": 724.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, everyone, thanks for listening, and until next time, goodbye.",
      "trans": "英语：很好，大家，谢谢你们的聆听，并且下一次见。",
      "start": 724.64,
      "end": 727.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "拜。",
      "start": 727.64,
      "end": 728.64
    }
  ]
}